      "statement": "Qualification extends only to evaluated revisions, envelopes, branches and populations. Mechanical document checks and source-linked Reviewer evaluation are bound together without substituting for one another; structural checks prove no semantic truth. Indeterminate never becomes satisfied, and neither a closed indeterminate result nor a review event resolves an obligation. Work-item closure applies only to the selected branch; sufficient direct outcomes record satisfied conditions in their carrier. The trace describes twenty-six trial obligations and twenty-four application conditions as applications of existing consequences, not additional rules.",
